<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero hero-small">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Data Export Request</h1>
    <p class="section-lead">GDPR Article 20: Right to Data Portability</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="form-container" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">

<h2>Export Your Personal Data</h2>

<p>Under GDPR Article 20, you have the right to receive your personal data in a portable, machine-readable format. We will provide all data we hold about you within 30 days of your request.</p>

<p><strong>This includes:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>All rental requests you've submitted</li>
  <li>Your contact information</li>
  <li>Event details and dates</li>
  <li>Items you requested</li>
  <li>Any messages or notes you provided</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Available formats:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>JSON:</strong> Machine-readable, can be imported into other services</li>
  <li><strong>CSV:</strong> Spreadsheet format, easy to view in Excel or Google Sheets</li>
</ul>

<form id="exportForm" method="POST" action="/gdpr/export" style="background: #f9f9f9; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #eee;">

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="email">Your Email Address</label>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="your@email.com" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1rem;">
    <small>Enter the email associated with your rental request(s)</small>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="format">Export Format</label>
    <select id="format" name="format" required style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1rem;">
      <option value="">-- Select a format --</option>
      <option value="json">JSON (Machine-readable)</option>
      <option value="csv">CSV (Spreadsheet)</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group" style="background: #fffacd; padding: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #ffd700; border-radius: 4px; margin: 1rem 0;">
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 0.5rem;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="confirm" name="confirm" required style="margin-top: 0.25rem;">
      <span>I confirm that this is my email address and I'm requesting my personal data</span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border: none; border-radius: 4px; background: #2c5aa0; color: white;">
      Download My Data
    </button>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">
    Your data will be prepared and downloaded to your computer. No email will be sent.
  </p>

</form>

<div style="background: #f0f8ff; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #2c5aa0; margin-top: 2rem;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Questions?</h3>
  <p>If you experience any issues with the export, or if you'd prefer we send your data via email, please contact us:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:[EMAIL ADDRESS]">[EMAIL ADDRESS]</a></li>
    <li><strong>Phone:</strong> [PHONE NUMBER]</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 0;">We will respond to all GDPR requests within 30 days.</p>
</div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.form-container input, .form-container select, .form-container button {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.form-group {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.form-group label {
  display: block;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: #333;
}

.form-group small {
  display: block;
  color: #666;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
}
</style>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
